        "Vitamin D deficiency causes Rickets in children and Osteomalacia in adults.",
        "Kwashiorkor is caused specifically by severe protein deficiency, while Marasmus results from overall calorie and protein deficiency.",
        "Iron deficiency is the leading cause of Anaemia, impacting hemoglobin synthesis."
